Phase 4 implementation complete. Here's what was created:

## Files Created/Modified

### New Files

**`src/market_matcher.py`** - Core market matching module:
- `get_embedding()` - OpenAI embeddings with local Ollama fallback
- `cosine_similarity()` - Vector similarity using numpy
- `fetch_polymarket_markets()` - Fetch active markets from Polymarket API
- `match_claim_to_markets()` - Semantic matching with thresholds (≥0.85 auto, 0.75-0.85 review)
- `link_prediction_to_market()` - Add `market_link` to predictions
- `add_market_judgement()` - Create market-based judgement (weight 1.2)
- `queue_for_review()` / `get_review_queue()` - Ambiguous match handling
- `batch_match_predictions()` - Batch processing

**`scripts/market_price_worker.py`** - Price polling daemon:
- Polls every 6 hours for linked predictions
- Updates `market_prices` array with price history
- Detects market resolutions and applies as ground truth
- Logs conflicts to `data/market_conflicts.jsonl`

### Modified Files

**`scripts/panel_adjudicate.py`** - Market signal integration:
- Imports `add_market_judgement` from market_matcher
- Adds market vote (weight 1.2) during adjudication
- Reduces LLM weights to 0.8 when market signal present

**`src/app.py`** - New API endpoints:
- `GET /api/prediction/{id}/market` - Market link + price history
- `POST /api/prediction/{id}/market/link` - Manual market linking
- `GET /api/markets/conflicts` - Resolution conflicts
- `GET /api/markets/review-queue` - Pending reviews (0.75-0.85 similarity)
- `POST /api/markets/review` - Resolve review items
- `GET /api/markets/stats` - Market integration statistics

### Data Model Extensions

Predictions gain new fields per DESIGN_STEALS.md:
```json
{
  "market_link": {
    "platform": "polymarket",
    "market_id": "0x...",
    "market_question": "...",
    "match_confidence": 0.92,
    "match_method": "embedding_auto",
    "linked_at": "..."
  },
  "market_prices": [{"ts": "...", "price": 0.65}],
  "resolution_source": "polymarket"
}
```
